    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nWhen starting a new nvim instance using `:!` or the API, it freezes, forcing me to forcefully close my terminal emulator.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n`$ nvim --clean`\n`:!nvim --clean`\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nLike vim, a new instance starts using the window and on exit returns back to the previous instance.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.12.2\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno, vim 9.2.450\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nLinux 7.0.3-arch1-2 x86_64 \n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nkitty 0.46.2\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nkitty\n\n### Installation\n\nArch User Repository (AUR)",
